{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>MediTrackPLUS 是一款用藥管理 App，方便每日定時服藥或服用補充品、同時管理多種藥物、需要提醒與服藥紀錄的人士使用，亦適合照顧者協助家人整理服藥安排。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-52.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>用藥提醒與今日進度一覽</h2>\n<p>加入藥物名稱、劑量、服用指示與起訖日期。今日頁面把劑量分為逾期、即將到期與已完成，一鍵標記已服用或略過，誤按可撤銷。支援每天、隔天或指定日子重複排程及劑量提醒，並有進度圖表、歷史紀錄與健康日誌，可記錄血壓、體重等數據，另可匯出報告與備份還原。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-454-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-455-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-456-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-457-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-458-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-459-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：MediTrackPLUS</li>\n<li>應用類別：Medical</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/meditrackplus/id6790893363?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:55:02.117308+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":285,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T14:12:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T17:38:04.802209+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:51:43.382585+00:00","content_hash":"6c5806a69a06545142acc802a2dbf0c3b561870113c99ecee5cb461d6091ecf7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:55:02.117308+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}